# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendor firmware is NOT redistributed in this repository.
#
# It is the manufacturer's property, and the README documents the exact
# content-addressed CDN link you can fetch it from instead. To vendor the
# .dav deliberately, delete the `firmware/*.dav` line below - see README
# "Legal" for the trade-off.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
firmware/*.dav

# Extracted artifacts — regenerate any time with ./unpack-dav.sh
firmware/unpacked/
firmware/rootfs/
unpacked/
rootfs/

# Never commit credentials.
.env
*.env
credentials*
secrets*
*password*

# macOS
.DS_Store
